<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help",
    "You do not need an account to look around. Open the chat and you land in #lobby with the conversation arriving live, under a guest name such as Guest4821 that you get for the visit."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_channels}>{dgettext("help", "What you can do")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help", "Read the public channels as they happen, and scroll back through them")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help",
      "Open other channels from the sidebar, from Browse all, or from a #channel link in a message"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help", "See who is in each channel, and close a channel's tab when you are done")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help",
      "Share a channel: its address is /c/ followed by its name, and the address bar shows it while the channel is in front"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help", "Taking part")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help",
    "Where the message box would be, a bar says you are watching as a visitor. Its Create an account to talk button opens the Connect window, and once you sign in you come back to the same channel."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help",
    "Everything that does something needs an account: writing, reacting, the menus and settings, games, calls, spaces, private sessions — and following any link, whether to a game or to another site. Each of them opens the Connect window instead, saying which feature it was."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help",
    "A link to a game, a call or a space opens the chat with that window, and after you sign in it takes you to the link."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_watching}>{dgettext("help", "Visitors in the user list")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help",
    "Everybody in a channel sees its visitors under Visitors, at the foot of the user list, and counted in the number beside the channel. A visitor is not a member: they cannot write, have no role, and leave the list when they close the tab."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help", "Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help",
      "Secret, private, invite-only and keyed channels cannot be watched — a channel that becomes one closes for its visitors"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help",
      "Guest names are reserved: nobody can register one or change to one"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help", "Nothing is kept for a visitor; a new visit gets a new guest name")}</li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="connecting">{dgettext("help", "Connecting")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="channels">{dgettext("help", "Channels")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-public-archive">
    {dgettext("help", "Public Channel Archive")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
